  "system": {
    "identifier": "uchiha-uchiha-flame-ball",
    "description": "<p>You exhale a stream of fire that you then detonate creating a dome of incinerating flame. You fire a 5-foot wide and up to 60 feet long beam of flame in a straight line originating from you. Select a point of a space your beam of fire passes through as the beam stops and detonates, filling a 20-foot radius, centered on this point of blazing flames. All creatures in both this Jutsu's stream and sphere, must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d6+6 fire damage and being blown Off-Guard until the end of your next turn on a failed save or half as much on a success and no further effect.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d6+1.</p>",
